### ============================================
### VIBE SEARCH API - Complete Test Suite
### ============================================

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Root Endpoint (API Info)
GET http://localhost:3000/

### ============================================
### PRODUCT SEARCH ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### Text Search - Basic (Beach/Summer Query)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "beach shorts for summer vacation",
  "top_k": 10
}

### Text Search - Simple Keyword
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "sneakers",
  "top_k": 10
}

### Text Search - With Category Filter
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "shorts",
  "top_k": 10,
  "filters": {
    "category": ["Bottoms"]
  }
}

### Text Search - With Multiple Filters
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "sneakers",
  "top_k": 5,
  "filters": {
    "category": ["Footwear"],
    "brands": ["Nike", "Adidas"],
    "price_range": [50, 200]
  }
}

### Text Search - Luxury Items
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "luxury watch",
  "top_k": 5
}

### Text Search - Streetwear
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "streetwear hoodie",
  "top_k": 10
}

### Image Search - Basic (URL)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/image
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "external_image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542291026-7eec264c27ff?w=800",
  "top_k": 10
}

### Image Search - Base64 (Alternative to file upload)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/image
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image_base64": "data:image/jpeg;base64,",
  "top_k": 10
}

### Image Search - File Upload (Use with form-data)
# Note: Use multipart/form-data with field name "image"
# POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/image
# Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
# 
# ------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
# Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="test.jpg"
# Content-Type: image/jpeg
# 
# < ./path/to/your/image.jpg
# ------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
# Content-Disposition: form-data; name="top_k"
# 
# 10
# ------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Image Search - With Filters
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/image
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "external_image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542291026-7eec264c27ff?w=800",
  "top_k": 5,
  "filters": {
    "category": ["Footwear"],
    "price_range": [50, 300]
  },
  "rerank": true
}

### Image Search - Using Scraped Image URL
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/image
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "external_image_url": "https://i.pinimg.com/564x/example.jpg",
  "top_k": 10
}

### Hybrid Search - Image + Text
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/hybrid
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542291026-7eec264c27ff?w=800",
  "query": "black white sneakers",
  "top_k": 10,
  "visual_weight": 0.6,
  "text_weight": 0.4
}

### Hybrid Search - Text Only
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/hybrid
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "luxury watch",
  "top_k": 5
}

### Hybrid Search - Image Only
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/hybrid
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542291026-7eec264c27ff?w=800",
  "top_k": 10
}

### Hybrid Search - With Filters
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/hybrid
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542291026-7eec264c27ff?w=800",
  "query": "sneakers",
  "top_k": 5,
  "filters": {
    "category": ["Footwear"],
    "brands": ["Nike"]
  },
  "visual_weight": 0.7,
  "text_weight": 0.3
}

### ============================================
### SCRAPED IMAGES ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### Get Scraped Images Gallery - All
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search/scraped-images?limit=50&offset=0

### Get Scraped Images Gallery - Pinterest Only
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search/scraped-images?platform=pinterest&limit=50&offset=0

### Get Scraped Images Gallery - Instagram Only
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search/scraped-images?platform=instagram&limit=50&offset=0

### Get Scraped Images Gallery - Pagination (Page 2)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search/scraped-images?limit=20&offset=20

### Search Scraped Images - By Image
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/scraped-images
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542291026-7eec264c27ff?w=800",
  "top_k": 10,
  "platform": "pinterest"
}

### Search Scraped Images - By Text (Streetwear)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/scraped-images
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "streetwear outfit",
  "top_k": 10,
  "platform": "pinterest"
}

### Search Scraped Images - By Text (Fashion)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/scraped-images
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "fashion",
  "top_k": 20
}

### Search Scraped Images - By Text (Luxury)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/scraped-images
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "luxury fashion",
  "top_k": 10,
  "platform": "instagram"
}

### ============================================
### PRODUCTS ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### Get All Products
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search/products?limit=50&offset=0

### Get Products - Pagination (Page 2)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search/products?limit=20&offset=20

### ============================================
### UNIFIED ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### Get Unified Data (Scraped Images + Products)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search/unified?scraped_limit=20&products_limit=20

### Get Unified Data - Pinterest Only
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search/unified?scraped_limit=20&products_limit=20&platform=pinterest

### Get Unified Data - Instagram Only
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search/unified?scraped_limit=20&products_limit=20&platform=instagram

### Get Unified Data - Custom Limits
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search/unified?scraped_limit=10&products_limit=30&scraped_offset=0&products_offset=0

### ============================================
### CLICK-TO-SEARCH ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### Search Products from Scraped Image (Click to Search)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/from-scraped-image
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scraped_image_id": 1,
  "top_k": 10
}

### Search Products from Scraped Image - With Filters
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/from-scraped-image
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scraped_image_id": 1,
  "top_k": 10,
  "filters": {
    "category": ["Footwear"],
    "price_range": [50, 200]
  }
}

### Search Products from Scraped Image - Category Filter
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/from-scraped-image
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scraped_image_id": 1,
  "top_k": 5,
  "filters": {
    "category": ["Bottoms"],
    "brands": ["Patagonia", "Ralph Lauren"]
  }
}

### ============================================
### ERROR TESTING (Optional)
### ============================================

### Invalid Text Search - Empty Query
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "",
  "top_k": 10
}

### Invalid Image Search - Invalid URL
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/image
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "external_image_url": "not-a-valid-url",
  "top_k": 10
}

### Invalid Scraped Image ID
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/from-scraped-image
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scraped_image_id": 99999,
  "top_k": 10
}

### Invalid Filters - Negative Price
POST http://localhost:3000/api/search/text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "sneakers",
  "top_k": 10,
  "filters": {
    "price_range": [-10, 200]
  }
}
